{
 "total": 40.304,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.176,
   "texto": "That fire pit is way too close to your house!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.296,
   "b": 4.77,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo wanted it right by the door!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 4.89,
   "b": 7.571,
   "texto": "It's cozy! I can grab snacks without walking!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 7.691,
   "b": 12.268,
   "texto": "Sparks float up and drift. Wood siding, a deck, a tree branch, they can all catch.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 12.388,
   "b": 15.265,
   "texto": "And under that tree? The heat rises right into the leaves.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 15.385,
   "b": 17.038,
   "texto": "So how far is far enough?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 17.158,
   "b": 20.714,
   "texto": "Most safety guides say at least ten feet from your house and anything that burns.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 20.834,
   "b": 23.782,
   "texto": "Some towns say twenty five. Check your local fire rules.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 23.902,
   "b": 26.787,
   "texto": "Keep it out from under branches, and never on a covered porch.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 26.907,
   "b": 28.348,
   "texto": "And if it gets out of hand?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 28.468,
   "b": 31.828,
   "texto": "Keep a hose or an extinguisher close, and never leave the fire alone.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 31.948,
   "b": 34.656,
   "texto": "Fine. Ten steps for snacks. I'll survive.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 34.776,
   "b": 38.106,
   "texto": "Cozy by the door, or ten feet away? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 38.226,
   "b": 40.304,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
